========================================================================
TEXTILE WASTE INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM — HOW TO RUN & DEPLOY
========================================================================

1. RUN LOCAL BACKEND (FastAPI):
------------------------------------------------------------------------
cd backend
venv\Scripts\activate
python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload

Backend URL: http://localhost:8000
API Docs:    http://localhost:8000/docs


2. RUN LOCAL FRONTEND (React + Vite):
------------------------------------------------------------------------
cd frontend
npm run dev

Frontend UI: http://localhost:5173


3. RUN FULL AUTOMATED TEST SUITE (41 Tests):
------------------------------------------------------------------------
cd backend
venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest tests/ -v


4. RUN WITH DOCKER (Local / Development):
------------------------------------------------------------------------
docker compose up --build


5. DEPLOY TO AWS CLOUD SERVICES (Production):
------------------------------------------------------------------------
See docs/AWS_Deployment_Guide.md for full AWS details.
For EC2 One-Click Deployment:
1. ./aws/setup_ec2.sh
2. ./aws/deploy_aws.sh


